>
>Why not just wish for the ring?
>
>
Because that's one less ring you can wear.  IMO, you should not be able
to wish for intrinsics.  The game would become much easier. Instead of 
wearing those rings of teleport control and fire resistance, you could
now wear those rings of +5 protection.  Even with wishes, still not having 
necessary intrinsics makes the game challenging.  Plus, it's always
challenging trying to find monsters to give you intrinsics and not be
killed in the process.


